      "title": "Mercer storms to victory in Austin",
      "slug": "mercer-storms-to-victory-in-austin",
      "excerpt": "A masterclass in tyre management delivered our first win of the autumn swing.",
      "body": "## Lights out and away\n\nAlex Mercer started from P3 and made a brilliant move into Turn 1, then managed the gap for 56 laps.\n\n**Mateo Ruiz** brought it home in P4 to secure a big haul of constructors' points.\n\n> \"The car was on rails today. Huge thanks to everyone back at the factory.\" — Alex",
